{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初述大意　次說來由　三釋題目　四隨文解釋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦是種種\n門等也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一切也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "平聲，空也。通上言一切皆空，此是種子字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生也，虛空藏也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "普遍也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "虛空也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "極惡也。所謂暴惡之中又甚暴惡也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大忿怒也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "破壞也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "恐怖也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "堅固也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無甘反"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "歸命一切諸佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "行也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一切所害也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鉤"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合\n菩提行也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "滿足也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "歸命一切金剛也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是暴惡也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大忿怒義也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "恐怖也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "戰字\n\n有遮聲是生死，謂離生死"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大忿怒也。如上所說無能敵者，所以大忿怒也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同前，具三解脫也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "同前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大力也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十力也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "得也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三合，大慈也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "發也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合，一切方處所也。謂十方皆須結遍也。又隨\n方皆遍也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "母感反，上句結，下句界。此意云一切方處所結界也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大三昧耶，以此大三昧耶而結諸界"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從生也，謂從大三昧耶生也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "奴皆反，憶念也，謂憶念一切佛教也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "光威也。由光威故成結界。馱是法界，\n迦是作言。法界體離諸作，離作即是法界之義也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "遮是滅義，謂生死遷移也。羅是\n垢障也。都句亦是行辨。是遍結十方界也，亦是來去也。重稱之，即是極來也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "釋句\n是結義。上是縛義，下是空。猶無縛故，等於虛空。以此結界，故無能壞也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上聲呼，十也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "方也，即是結十方也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一切佛也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "教也，是一\n切佛之教，前所令憶念也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "所證也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法也，即諸佛所證法也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "獲也，證也，得也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即無能勝也，於諸障中最為是勝也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即真言主也，歎世尊德也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "除也，能除垢也。初勸除，亦是勸令莫作"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "除也，\n前句除有相垢，後句除離相之垢，即是除一切障也。即是莫作，正是除也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "種子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "長引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "句義，\n是宮也，處所也。以真法除垢除相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "歸命，如前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "離相三昧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "吠音，二羅，二我相也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第一義，第一義不可得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "離垢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "離縛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "矩音作"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "離相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是呼召義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是童子義，\n即是呼召一一憶本願也。又俱是摧破之義。摩囉，是魔眷屬，所謂四魔。此真言以麼字為體，即是大空義也。證此\n大空，摧壞一切魔也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "解脫道住者，謂呼此童子住於解脫\n道者，即是諸佛解脫，所謂大涅槃也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "憶念憶念也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "先所五願也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "歸命，如前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一切也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無慧\n也。以無慧故名之為疑，此字正釋名為疑也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "除也，此是除棄之義。如人除棄糞穢，\n名除糞也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "法界也。為除一切無慧，皆令住於法界也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生也。涅字\n即入大空三昧，從此而生即是法界生也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此三字皆是種子也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一切煩惱也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "摧伏也。通上句，云摧伏一切煩\n惱也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一切法也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "得自在也。通上句，云於\n諸法中而得自在也，以除諸障故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "虛空也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "入"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "平聲，中有阿聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "入"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "娑摩是平等義，即是等同虛空也。行等空無邊清淨也。於一切自在無礙，同於虛空也。下句與阿相\n連，是無等也。不等者，即是二乘，以有所闕，故名無等。即是施權意也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "入"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即是一切如來，謂十方三世諸佛也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "觀也。同彼佛所觀，故名諸如來之觀，即是\n平等觀也，即是普觀也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "悲義也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "體也。所謂大悲為體也。猶如金人，以彼自\n體純是金故，名為金人。此菩薩亦爾，純以大悲為體也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "訶是行義，是喜義。是三行者，即是三乘人行也。此字入阿字門，即此三行本來不生。由本不生故，即越\n此三行，是為佛行也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是奇哉怪哉之義也。如佛常教，以慈對治於瞋、以無貪治\n貪、以正見除邪見。今乃以大忿瞋而除忿瞋、以大貪除一切貪，此則最難信難解，故言怪哉也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一切諸佛也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "境界也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生也，謂從諸佛境而生也。佛境界者，\n所謂諸法實相。從此實相而生，故號為降三世也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "入"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二合，即是三界\n也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是降勝之義也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "義同上說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "呼召警覺之義。若誦此，能遍入一切眾生\n心而警覺之，令除垢障，等於法身之佛也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "入"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "X23n0440_p0662c20"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T44n1851_p0765b14"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "X23n0440_p0664a01"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "X23n0440_p0664a01"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "X23n0440_p0670b10"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "X23n0440_p0670c23"}
{"id": null, "n": "0802002", "target": null, "type": "orig", "text": "乙本冠註曰大本無明字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "X23n0440_p0673c12"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T54n2128_p0425a09"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf2", "text": "X16n0318_p0889c08"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T54n2128_p0425a09"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf2", "text": "X16n0318_p0889c08"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T54n2128_p0425a09"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf2", "text": "X16n0318_p0889c08"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T54n2128_p0425a09"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf2", "text": "X16n0318_p0889c08"}
{"id": null, "n": "0790002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0790002", "type": "mod", "text": "再【大】，〔－〕【甲】【乙】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0790003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0790003", "type": "mod", "text": "太【大】，大【甲】【乙】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0791001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0791001", "type": "mod", "text": "功德大海【大】，〔－〕【考偽-乙】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0791002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0791002", "type": "mod", "text": "活【大】，沽【考偽-乙】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0792001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0792001", "type": "mod", "text": "水【大】，漿【考偽-乙】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0792003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0792003", "type": "mod", "text": "生【大】，在【校異-乙】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0792008", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0792008", "type": "mod", "text": "見【大】，是【校異-原】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0792010", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0792010", "type": "mod", "text": "苦【CB】【卍續-CB】【甲】【乙】，若【大】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0793005", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0793005", "type": "mod", "text": "抑揚【CB】【卍續-CB】【乙】＊，柳楊【大】＊"}
{"id": null, "n": "0793008", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0793008", "type": "mod", "text": "知【大】，智【乙】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0793009", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0793009", "type": "mod", "text": "地【大】，地如【校異-原】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0794001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0794001", "type": "mod", "text": "皆【大】，〔－〕【甲】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0795005", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0795005", "type": "mod", "text": "世【大】，生【校異-原】，生【甲】【乙】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0795006", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0795006", "type": "mod", "text": "復【大】，後【甲】【乙】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0796001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0796001", "type": "mod", "text": "即【大】，金剛即【校異-原】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0796002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0796002", "type": "mod", "text": "剛【大】，剛眼【校異-原】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0796003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0796003", "type": "mod", "text": "眷屬【大】，〔－〕【校異-原】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0796004", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0796004", "type": "mod", "text": "為【大】，為作【校異-原】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0796005", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0796005", "type": "mod", "text": "際【大】，隙【考偽-乙】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0797006", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0797006", "type": "mod", "text": "處【大】，〔－〕【考偽-乙】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0797009", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0797009", "type": "mod", "text": "指【大】，攝【考偽-乙】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0799002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0799002", "type": "mod", "text": "如【大】，妙【校異-原】，妙【乙】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0800001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0800001", "type": "mod", "text": "願【大】，獻【考偽-乙】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0800002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0800002", "type": "mod", "text": "池【大】＊，河【考偽-乙】＊"}
{"id": null, "n": "0800003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0800003", "type": "mod", "text": "三【大】，第三【考偽-乙】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0801001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0801001", "type": "mod", "text": "盧【大】，盧者【校異-原】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0801002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0801002", "type": "mod", "text": "是【大】，是空義【校異-原】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0801003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0801003", "type": "mod", "text": "散【大】，敗【校異-原】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0801004", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0801004", "type": "mod", "text": "四【大】，第四【考偽-乙】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0801006", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0801006", "type": "mod", "text": "令【大】，合【校異-原】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0801007", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0801007", "type": "mod", "text": "字【大】，〔－〕【考偽-乙】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0802001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0802001", "type": "mod", "text": "持明【大】，〔－〕【校異-原】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0802003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0802003", "type": "mod", "text": "破【大】，能破【校異-原】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0802004", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0802004", "type": "mod", "text": "二合【大】，〔－〕【校異-原】"}
